just boot the system to ARC, and find the prompts for ``update
firmware''.  Put the floppy in, and let it go at it..

	As to creating the update, you should be able to do it
from Linux using dd(1). (follow the instructions for Tru64/DEC
Unix on the DEC firmware web site..)

