Hello,

The miata has a qlogic controller for standart scsi devices.
I have installed a lot of them with linux but none had a problem like that.
It can't be a firmware problem either because i have tried a lot of
versions.
It's the termination or you have a bad block on the disk.
It looks like a bad block because the sectors are somewhere in the end or
middle of the disk. Not in the begin where your system begins to check the
disk.
But i would also check the termination because anything can happen when
that's not ok.

With kind regards Marco Ruiter
