Hi, in the upper right conner of the OS Loader setup window in AlphaBIOS,
there should be a OS selection field. You should set it to "generic"
instead of OpenVMS or other OS in order to have Hard disk option available.

Then after you set the boot file path ( linload.exe) correctly, everything
is set only if your linload.exe and milo are in the same directory. Don't
mind OS path.
As to OS option, you can set it as : boot sda1:vmlinux.gz  root=/dev/sda1
( if you have copied the vmlinux.gz to the root directory)
Wish you luck!

