  Nothing that is AGP will fit.  Only the new Slot-B 21264 Alpha's have AGP
slots.  You need to find something PCI.  I have succesfully used a 4 meg
Permedia 2V and a 2 meg Matrox Mystique in my Alpha.
  I would also recommend staying away from any cards with integrated TV
in/out.  Most TV out doesn't work with X, and the TV in on video cards is
very hard to support.
  Other cards I have heard working with X on the Alpha are:
S3 virge based
Almost all Matrox cards
TGA (The original 8-bit and I think the 24 bit)

  There has been some work with the Cirrus Logic chipset on the Alpha, I got
a 5446 to work once, but I can't duplicate it.
  If anyone is interested in starting a list of video cards for alpha, let
me know I'll compile something.

