Check out
http://www.unix.digital.com/linux/      and http://www.alphalinux.org

follow the documentation links..

To get your 3300 to the SRM console,  type F2 to get to the AlphaBIOS setup
screen,  then go to CMOS Setup. Then type F6, advanced setup,  3/4 the way
down the screen is the default console selections. Select  "SRM Unix"  .
Then type F10 to save the settings. After settings are saved, reboot the
system and you will be at the SRM console.  If you want to switch back to
AlphaBIOS, type  "set os_type nt" then power cycle the machine, you will be
back in the AlphaBIOS console (NT).

Hope this helps.

JJ

