	I would look a little closer if I were you.  There are significant
differences between the PC164 and the PC164sx.  Some that I know of are,
the PC164 uses the ACR console while the PC164sx uses the Alpha Bios. 
The PC164sx uses the 21164pc processor which is physically smaller then
the 21164 in the PC164.  From what I remember, the 21164 is some what
crippled (smaller cache ect..)  but runs faster.  The sx also uses the
Pixis chip set which is not on the PC164.  I'm also quite sure that the
PC164 top speed is 500MHz. 
	I personally like the sx although I have a PC164 at home.

dave


