is a broken ping and the drivers for the tulip cards. Some time ago there
was a patch posted in this newsgroup by Alex Rhomberg which you will find
here:

http://x29.deja.com/[ST_rn=ps]/getdoc.xp?AN=477844845&CONTEXT=930820428.968425498&hitnum=11

or in

